WEBVTT

01:42.960 --> 01:44.920
NISHANG COURTYARD

01:45.000 --> 01:46.520
Hold the needle steady and firm.

01:46.600 --> 01:48.240
It's all in the wrist strength.

01:48.320 --> 01:49.760
If you want to hold
an embroidery needle well,

01:50.360 --> 01:52.080
you must first be able
to lift a heavy stone.

01:53.080 --> 01:56.200
Those who want a future, don't be lazy.

02:10.280 --> 02:12.880
Strength comes from the arm,
not the wrist.

02:16.840 --> 02:17.840
What's going on?

02:24.760 --> 02:25.800
This…

02:26.400 --> 02:27.600
It doesn't seem new?

02:27.680 --> 02:28.760
Yes.

02:30.200 --> 02:32.320
I burned myself a few days ago
by accident.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.320
Fine.

02:38.400 --> 02:39.920
Go and rest for now.

02:40.600 --> 02:42.280
Learning skills takes time.

02:43.040 --> 02:46.000
Don't let this scar
affect your attribution.

02:46.840 --> 02:47.680
Yes.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.200
Take her to rest.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.120
- Yes.
- Yes.

03:00.120 --> 03:02.440
She took her own life
in fear of punishment

03:02.520 --> 03:03.840
for damaging
the late Empress's embroidery.

03:04.680 --> 03:07.160
Remember, the job must be done well.

03:07.240 --> 03:08.600
No loose ends.

03:30.920 --> 03:32.120
Go inside.

04:19.480 --> 04:20.519
Your Highness?

04:22.840 --> 04:24.120
Stay quiet.

04:34.840 --> 04:35.960
How dare you!

04:40.320 --> 04:41.960
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

04:49.200 --> 04:54.000
This embroidery was the final masterpiece
of Empress Dejia.

04:54.080 --> 04:55.840
A flaw on such a piece

04:55.920 --> 04:58.200
is a grave disrespect to the late Empress.

04:58.800 --> 05:02.840
I will surely see the culprit
severely punished.

05:03.480 --> 05:06.640
Attendant Shang,
how do you plan to punish her?

05:07.920 --> 05:10.400
This woman holds a grudge
against Your Highness,

05:11.080 --> 05:13.840
and that's why she damaged
the late Empress's work.

05:13.920 --> 05:16.680
She deserves nothing less than execution.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.120
Really?

05:21.360 --> 05:23.360
But I saw with my own eyes

05:23.440 --> 05:26.440
a stray cat leaping at the embroidery.

05:26.520 --> 05:28.600
The beauty tried to stop the cat,
and in doing so,

05:29.520 --> 05:31.000
accidentally damaged the piece.

05:32.120 --> 05:33.520
Luckily, I was there.

05:34.160 --> 05:35.120
The beauty

05:36.040 --> 05:37.640
wouldn't have to bear this guilt.

05:44.960 --> 05:46.240
Your Highness, you are wise.

05:46.320 --> 05:48.240
I would never dare disrespect.

05:49.880 --> 05:51.880
Cat? A stray cat?

05:52.520 --> 05:53.360
Yes.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.640
A stray cat.

05:58.280 --> 05:59.880
They were there too.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.760
They can bear witness.

06:03.160 --> 06:07.200
If it wasn't a cat,
then you mean I'm wrong.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.600
Or could it be

06:10.080 --> 06:12.200
that you deliberately damaged
the embroidery?

06:12.280 --> 06:14.000
- It was a cat.
- It was a cat.

06:14.080 --> 06:15.120
- Your Highness. You judged correctly.
- Your Highness. You judged correctly.

06:17.440 --> 06:20.040
These two servants were tasked
with guarding the piece,

06:20.640 --> 06:22.240
but they were neglectful.

06:22.320 --> 06:23.520
Thirty lashes for them.

06:24.160 --> 06:25.400
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

06:29.120 --> 06:31.800
Since it was an accident
on the beauty's part,

06:31.880 --> 06:34.600
she will be confined to my mansion.

06:34.680 --> 06:39.080
I will personally supervise her
as she repairs the embroidery.

06:39.160 --> 06:42.480
Once it's fixed,
her offense will be forgiven.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.520
Your Highness.

06:56.520 --> 06:59.080
It is essential
that the screen be repaired.

06:59.680 --> 07:02.760
However, it is too valuable
to be moved again.

07:03.960 --> 07:06.600
It's better to confine her here,
at the Court of State Ceremonial,

07:06.680 --> 07:07.960
and have her repair it on-site.

07:08.040 --> 07:11.040
I am responsible
for overseeing the studies here.

07:11.120 --> 07:13.480
The beauty's mistake
is also my responsibility.

07:13.560 --> 07:15.520
If the Emperor or Crown Prince
seeks accountability,

07:15.600 --> 07:17.280
I will take full responsibility.

07:20.920 --> 07:22.560
Since you are willing
to bear the responsibility,

07:22.640 --> 07:25.400
then I'll leave both the beauty

07:25.480 --> 07:27.200
and the screen in your care.

07:27.280 --> 07:29.240
If anything goes wrong again,

07:29.320 --> 07:32.240
I will come directly to you.

07:32.320 --> 07:33.960
No need to worry, Your Highness.

07:34.040 --> 07:35.600
This is my duty.

07:36.200 --> 07:38.640
Very well. Everyone can disperse.

07:38.720 --> 07:40.240
Thank you, Your Highness.

07:52.200 --> 07:53.520
Thank you for saving me.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.880
I will do my best to fix it.

07:56.720 --> 07:58.880
Repairing it is just an excuse.

07:58.960 --> 08:00.120
You don't need
to concern yourself with it.

08:00.720 --> 08:01.840
Stay here peacefully,

08:02.440 --> 08:05.360
and if needed,
I will come to take you away.

08:14.320 --> 08:15.160
Continue.

08:15.680 --> 08:16.880
Yes, Your Highness.

08:16.960 --> 08:19.040
I thought it was only Mei Lin,

08:19.120 --> 08:21.000
but it turns out there are ten beauties,

08:21.600 --> 08:23.960
all of whom burned their wrists recently.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.240
One case could be considered an accident,

08:26.320 --> 08:30.400
but ten beauties dying
would be impossible to cover up.

08:31.000 --> 08:33.600
I couldn't bring myself to do it.

08:33.679 --> 08:36.320
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

08:38.360 --> 08:40.120
Attendant Shang, you've worked hard.

08:41.360 --> 08:42.919
Here, take this.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.680
The affairs at the Court
of State Ceremonial are complicated,

08:55.760 --> 08:58.080
so I appreciate you
running this errand for me.

08:58.160 --> 08:59.000
Now, return and rest.

09:02.160 --> 09:03.520
Thank you, Your Highness.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.680
Thank you, Your Highness.

09:06.040 --> 09:06.880
See you.

09:13.400 --> 09:14.880
Since she didn't finish the job,

09:16.400 --> 09:18.840
find her a good burial spot.

09:19.440 --> 09:20.680
I'll take care of it.

09:23.320 --> 09:26.280
It seems the woman who fled
from the Wenhua Pavilion is Mei Lin.

09:27.080 --> 09:30.320
But the Imperial Guards at the Court
are loyal to my father.

09:30.400 --> 09:31.840
We can't act recklessly there.

09:32.440 --> 09:35.160
She can't hide
in the Court forever, can she?

09:36.680 --> 09:39.280
We can't afford to wait.

09:40.600 --> 09:42.880
You mean we assassinate Mei Lin?

09:49.680 --> 09:53.800
Jinghe used poison to frame us once.

09:54.720 --> 09:57.080
We'll use his own tactic against him.

09:59.480 --> 10:01.920
I've had an arrow ready and no target.

10:05.520 --> 10:07.800
Let's make the most of this opportunity.

10:09.000 --> 10:11.760
Gan Ning from the Ministry of Defense
has long coveted Zhang Yin's position.

10:11.840 --> 10:12.920
Have him submit a memorial.

10:14.000 --> 10:14.840
Yes.

10:40.280 --> 10:41.640
How could he not care?

12:16.800 --> 12:17.640
My lord.

12:27.480 --> 12:28.320
My lord.

12:29.120 --> 12:31.160
The Imperial Household Department
is deliberately making things difficult.

12:31.240 --> 12:33.840
They don't want to lend us
Empress Dejia's embroidery guide at all.

12:35.160 --> 12:36.440
You and I are from Xiyan.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.880
The fact that they allowed me

12:39.960 --> 12:42.320
to copy the guide
was already a rare exception.

12:43.720 --> 12:47.440
But there's so much content,
you won't sleep tonight.

12:50.280 --> 12:52.240
I'll prepare some food for you.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.680
No need.

12:55.360 --> 12:57.560
You've only just recovered from a cold.

12:57.640 --> 12:58.840
Get some rest early.

13:03.640 --> 13:06.720
As long as you don't sleep,
neither will I.

13:08.920 --> 13:09.760
Alright.

13:17.920 --> 13:22.600
EMPRESS DEJIA'S GUIDE TO THE ART
OF INTERLACED STITCH EMBROIDERY

13:48.000 --> 13:48.840
Mr. Yue Qin.

13:49.480 --> 13:51.200
This is what I borrowed
from the Imperial Household Department.

13:51.280 --> 13:53.160
Empress Dejia's Guide to the Art
of Interlaced Stitch Embroidery.

13:53.840 --> 13:55.720
I hope it helps you.

13:56.280 --> 13:57.280
Thank you, Mr. Yue Qin.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.840
ART OF INTERLACED STITCH EMBROIDERY

14:00.920 --> 14:02.000
Watch out.

14:07.280 --> 14:08.440
Is this white vinegar?

14:09.240 --> 14:10.840
There's white vinegar in the water.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.000
Soak the embroidered screen in it.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.800
It'll soften the threads on the back,
so they won't be as stiff to the touch.

14:14.880 --> 14:17.680
I also brought some food,
in case you get hungry.

14:18.920 --> 14:19.760
You're too thoughtful.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.240
Let's get to work.

15:17.840 --> 15:19.520
ART OF INTERLACED STITCH EMBROIDERY

17:23.119 --> 17:24.319
Are you having trouble sleeping, my lord?

17:25.560 --> 17:26.720
What brings you here?

17:31.600 --> 17:32.840
Mei Lin has requested to see you.

17:35.920 --> 17:36.760
What's the matter?

17:37.720 --> 17:38.640
She didn't say.

17:38.720 --> 17:41.240
Just that you must go
to the Court of State Ceremonial.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.080
What is it?

17:57.520 --> 17:58.600
My lord.

17:58.680 --> 18:01.360
Empress Dejia must have had a reason
for embroidering this screen.

18:01.440 --> 18:03.920
I've told you before.
Mind your own business.

18:06.040 --> 18:06.880
There's a hidden pattern on the screen.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.160
There's an invisible thread
woven into the design.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.320
If you don't look closely,
you won't notice it.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.840
The hidden thread
leads to a secret pattern.

18:20.360 --> 18:22.560
The arrangement is very neat,
almost like a riddle.

18:34.480 --> 18:36.040
It's the Weibei Army flag semaphore.

18:39.360 --> 18:40.200
My…

18:41.840 --> 18:42.880
son…

18:44.920 --> 18:48.240
My son Jinghe is good by nature.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.920
He could never have been
the butcher of the city.

18:51.520 --> 18:53.000
But the rumor mill is churning.

18:54.040 --> 18:57.440
I made this embroidery
to appease the people's anger,

18:57.520 --> 18:59.080
hoping for a chance of survival
for my boy.

19:00.040 --> 19:01.480
Jinghe, my only wish
is for you to live on,

19:02.360 --> 19:03.400
to never lose hope.

19:04.200 --> 19:06.200
One day, the clouds will part,
and the truth will be revealed.

19:07.520 --> 19:09.440
Though we are separated by life and death,

19:10.560 --> 19:14.120
may you be safe, then my soul at peace.

19:43.040 --> 19:47.680
So, Her Majesty made this screen
to plead for your life.

19:49.120 --> 19:49.960
Mother.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.920
I was wrong.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.160
If not for saving me…

20:04.800 --> 20:06.480
the screen wouldn't have been damaged.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.920
It wasn't entirely for your sake.

20:14.480 --> 20:17.360
They intended
to use Mother's embroidery as a trap.

20:18.760 --> 20:20.520
If I hadn't acted first,

20:21.600 --> 20:23.440
the entire screen
might have been destroyed.

20:25.640 --> 20:28.520
Hearing Mother's last words

20:30.040 --> 20:31.360
is enough for me.

20:33.320 --> 20:34.920
A little damage

20:37.360 --> 20:38.320
doesn't matter.

20:39.760 --> 20:40.840
Yes, it does.

20:42.160 --> 20:45.640
The belongings of the deceased are bridges
between the living and the dead.

20:47.320 --> 20:49.160
If the screen isn't repaired properly,

20:50.400 --> 20:53.680
won't Her Majesty be unable
to hear what you want to say to her?

20:57.760 --> 21:01.320
Ghosts are nothing
more than the delusions of the living.

21:03.040 --> 21:03.880
They are not to be believed.

21:04.640 --> 21:06.360
I didn't believe in them either.

21:07.640 --> 21:10.880
But after my parents passed, I started to.

21:13.800 --> 21:16.160
I have many things I want to tell them.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.640
The Dengguo Cakes aren't sweet anymore.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.720
Mother's were always the best.

21:22.480 --> 21:26.320
My stone hairpin is old.
I want Father to make me a new one.

21:27.440 --> 21:30.920
I believe my parents
are always by my side.

21:31.000 --> 21:33.360
That's why I keep surviving close calls.

21:36.640 --> 21:39.200
Don't you have anything
you want to say to Her Majesty?

22:10.360 --> 22:12.160
It's close.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.080
But this thread's color seems off.

22:21.240 --> 22:24.520
I searched for a long time,
but I couldn't find this color anywhere.

22:43.560 --> 22:44.400
The thread…

22:45.840 --> 22:48.240
The pattern on your clothes is stitched
with the exact same thread, my lord.

23:07.680 --> 23:08.760
Did you miss a stitch?

23:13.160 --> 23:14.000
Here.

23:15.680 --> 23:18.240
In Interlaced Stitch embroidery,
it's easy to miss a stitch.

23:34.680 --> 23:35.840
You know how to embroider, my lord?

23:38.240 --> 23:39.520
I was mischievous as a child,

23:40.040 --> 23:41.560
often punished

23:41.640 --> 23:43.320
by being made to stand still,
watching my mother embroider.

23:44.400 --> 23:47.040
I learned by watching.

24:49.280 --> 24:50.400
Your Highness.

24:50.480 --> 24:53.160
It's getting chilly. Let's get back.

25:11.560 --> 25:12.600
It's done.

25:16.080 --> 25:17.520
It looks exactly like before.

25:29.400 --> 25:30.720
Whatever you wanted to say,

25:31.960 --> 25:33.920
Her Majesty will hear it now.

26:02.960 --> 26:03.880
Mother.

26:07.440 --> 26:08.920
I have returned.

26:15.640 --> 26:17.080
I…

26:20.040 --> 26:22.160
am doing well now.

26:38.880 --> 26:41.760
My lord, the screen is repaired.

26:41.840 --> 26:43.280
Can I leave now?

26:44.560 --> 26:45.680
Not yet.

26:45.760 --> 26:47.640
The culprits believe

26:47.720 --> 26:49.400
you are the witness
to the Wenhua Pavilion affair.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.840
They'll stop at nothing
to target you again.

26:53.240 --> 26:54.640
The timing
of when the screen is fully repaired

26:54.720 --> 26:56.480
is up to me.

26:57.200 --> 26:59.960
You're safest here.

27:00.040 --> 27:01.000
I'm not afraid of death.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.520
Even if you want to die,

27:06.600 --> 27:08.360
you should make your death meaningful.

27:08.880 --> 27:12.400
Your task is to stay here
and keep their attention diverted,

27:12.480 --> 27:13.720
so I can search for Zhang Yin.

27:14.680 --> 27:17.640
Once I find him, you'll be free to go.

27:23.320 --> 27:25.000
I'll play my role as a Xiyan beauty well.

27:29.120 --> 27:31.880
When necessary,
you don't need to play a beauty at all.

27:35.680 --> 27:37.160
I mean,

27:38.720 --> 27:39.840
when danger arises,

27:40.600 --> 27:42.040
you can reveal your martial arts
and defend yourself.

27:43.120 --> 27:45.280
My father is aware
of your Qingzhou origins.

27:45.360 --> 27:48.360
It's not surprising
that an orphan from Qingzhou

27:49.240 --> 27:50.280
learned martial arts for revenge.

28:10.360 --> 28:12.960
My lord, I've found out something.

28:13.040 --> 28:14.120
There's a woman named Meiniang

28:14.200 --> 28:15.920
who frequently buys Whitening Pills
at the black market.

28:16.000 --> 28:18.240
She has a peony flower mark on her neck.

28:19.080 --> 28:21.080
I've arranged for her
to meet with our contact in three days.

28:21.720 --> 28:23.680
Although Mei Lin
has stalled the Crown Prince for now,

28:24.720 --> 28:26.200
this won't last forever.

28:27.040 --> 28:28.680
The Crown Prince won't sit idly by.

28:28.760 --> 28:31.280
- Keep an eye on their faction.
- Yes, Your Highness.

28:34.400 --> 28:37.480
YANMING PALACE

28:37.560 --> 28:39.320
Gan Ning's memorial claims

28:40.640 --> 28:42.840
there's a spy
among the peace-making beauties.

28:44.040 --> 28:44.880
Xuanlie, what do you think?

28:45.880 --> 28:47.240
The Xiyan factions are complex.

28:47.320 --> 28:49.960
I suspect this is a provocation
led by Mingju from the hawkish faction.

28:50.040 --> 28:52.960
They intend to sow discord
between you and the King of Xiyan.

28:54.040 --> 28:55.920
As long as the Xiyan royal court
remains committed to peace,

28:56.000 --> 28:58.400
we can help the King
remove the rebellious tribes.

28:58.480 --> 28:59.760
So, investigating the mastermind

29:00.840 --> 29:02.480
is also for the sake of the King of Xiyan.

29:02.560 --> 29:04.520
Moreover,
Mr. Yue Qin is still in Zhaojing.

29:05.680 --> 29:07.360
This investigation
must be carried out in secret.

29:08.920 --> 29:12.040
Who do you think is suitable for the task?

29:13.880 --> 29:16.520
General Yin has fought
many campaigns against Xiyan.

29:16.600 --> 29:17.720
She's familiar with the situation.

29:20.320 --> 29:23.480
I believe she's the right person
for the job.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.280
Your Highness.

29:28.360 --> 29:29.760
Is General Yin still
at the West Suburbs Barracks?

29:29.840 --> 29:30.680
Yes.

29:31.200 --> 29:33.240
Let's go to the West Suburbs Barracks.

29:33.320 --> 29:34.160
I may be slow,

29:34.240 --> 29:36.600
but why not send our people
to investigate?

29:36.680 --> 29:38.720
What if General Yin
sides with Prince Jing?

29:40.920 --> 29:42.200
You don't know her.

29:42.840 --> 29:45.800
When it comes to Great Yan,
she would never show favoritism.

29:46.560 --> 29:47.680
But she's still clinging

29:47.760 --> 29:50.440
to some childhood ties
she won't let go of.

29:52.840 --> 29:55.040
It's time for me
to give her a little push.

29:55.960 --> 29:58.720
One! Two!

29:59.400 --> 30:00.240
Three!

30:01.240 --> 30:02.200
Four!

30:03.040 --> 30:04.800
Five! Six!

30:06.360 --> 30:07.200
Seven!

30:08.040 --> 30:08.880
Eight!

30:09.400 --> 30:11.360
One! Two!

30:12.240 --> 30:14.760
Three! Four!

30:15.360 --> 30:17.760
Five! Six!

30:18.440 --> 30:20.640
Seven! Eight!

30:35.480 --> 30:37.600
One! Two!

30:38.400 --> 30:39.320
Three!

30:40.440 --> 30:41.400
Four!

30:42.200 --> 30:43.040
Five!

30:43.920 --> 30:46.160
Six! Seven!

30:47.000 --> 30:48.560
Your Highness.

30:49.480 --> 30:51.400
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

30:57.920 --> 30:59.000
Your Highness, be careful!

30:59.080 --> 31:00.480
Protect His Highness! Quickly!

31:23.040 --> 31:24.080
Your Highness.

31:26.200 --> 31:27.400
Give me your hand!

31:44.240 --> 31:45.440
Please, Your Highness, forgive me.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.400
The coachman was negligent
and deserves punishment.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.360
This horse was a tribute from Xiyan,

31:49.440 --> 31:51.880
not yet fully tamed, and still
they dared to let you ride it.

31:53.000 --> 31:55.000
It's not their fault.
I insisted on riding it myself.

31:55.080 --> 31:56.640
I nearly embarrassed myself, General Yin.

31:58.120 --> 31:58.960
I wouldn't dare.

32:02.040 --> 32:03.240
We grew up together.

32:03.320 --> 32:05.800
Between you and me, there's no need
for formalities of ruler and subject.

32:27.120 --> 32:28.440
Here's some wound medicine.

32:49.000 --> 32:52.320
This dagger, did you win it from Jinghe?

32:54.120 --> 32:57.160
This dagger was one
he snatched from me long ago.

32:57.240 --> 32:59.160
I didn't expect it would end up
in your hands now.

32:59.240 --> 33:01.920
But today, this dagger belongs to me,

33:02.000 --> 33:03.280
so don't think about taking it back.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.880
What's meant to be yours
will always be yours.

33:05.960 --> 33:06.800
It's fate.

33:14.120 --> 33:15.760
Your Highness, let's head back.

33:16.520 --> 33:17.360
Luomei.

33:22.680 --> 33:24.240
I came today, not just for a visit.

33:24.320 --> 33:25.440
There's official business to discuss.

33:26.280 --> 33:27.520
Someone has submitted a memorial,

33:28.040 --> 33:30.480
claiming they've discovered
Xiyan spies in Zhaojing.

33:31.400 --> 33:33.280
Father is concerned
Xiyan might be planning something.

33:34.080 --> 33:36.440
So, he wants you to investigate
this matter in secret.

33:37.040 --> 33:38.480
Xiyan spies.

33:39.240 --> 33:41.720
They must have infiltrated
through the delegation.

33:44.880 --> 33:47.280
I suspect this is linked to Mingju
from the hawkish faction in Xiyan.

33:48.320 --> 33:51.160
Are we investigating this
for the King of Xiyan?

33:52.680 --> 33:53.920
I knew I had chosen the right person
for this task.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.880
You've fought many battles against Xiyan.

33:55.960 --> 33:57.480
You know the strategies
of both armies well.

33:57.560 --> 33:59.960
With you on this, Father can rest easy.

34:01.320 --> 34:02.160
I will follow your command.

34:07.360 --> 34:10.639
What concerns me most is Jinghe.

34:10.719 --> 34:13.440
This case is tied to Prince Jing?

34:15.360 --> 34:17.639
You've heard about the assassination
during the peace negotiations.

34:17.719 --> 34:19.560
I interrogated the assassin.

34:19.639 --> 34:20.880
She wasn't just any ordinary Beauty.

34:22.159 --> 34:23.320
I fear

34:23.400 --> 34:24.480
there's someone orchestrating chaos
behind the scenes,

34:24.560 --> 34:25.840
hoping to use Jinghe

34:25.920 --> 34:27.520
to stir up conflict
between the two nations.

34:30.199 --> 34:31.760
Prince Jing may act recklessly at times,

34:32.440 --> 34:34.199
but when it comes to matters of the state,

34:34.280 --> 34:35.800
he understands what's at stake.

34:48.880 --> 34:49.800
Big Brother.

34:56.040 --> 34:58.480
This dagger looks like it's part
of a pair. Where's the other one?

34:58.560 --> 35:00.120
There's no such thing as a pair.

35:00.200 --> 35:02.480
It was made from 1,000-year-old
cold iron, enough for only one.

35:03.520 --> 35:05.000
If you like it, I'll give it to you.

35:05.080 --> 35:06.560
I'm not really into daggers anyway.

35:06.640 --> 35:09.600
Luomei would like this much more.

35:12.920 --> 35:13.840
You better make sure
she doesn't take it from you.

35:13.920 --> 35:15.520
She'll have to beat me first.

35:21.720 --> 35:24.920
Luomei, we were destined to be a pair.

35:25.680 --> 35:27.560
CHANGXI PAVILION

35:35.080 --> 35:36.960
What brings General Yin
to the Court of State Ceremonial?

36:36.520 --> 36:37.400
Who are you?

36:57.880 --> 36:58.720
Please stop, sir.

36:58.800 --> 37:00.440
The General
is conducting an investigation.

37:01.040 --> 37:02.840
This matter has long been investigated.

37:02.920 --> 37:04.800
His Majesty himself decreed
it must never be discussed again.

37:04.880 --> 37:06.520
Is General Yin planning
to abuse her authority?

37:06.600 --> 37:09.840
Rest assured, sir.
The General knows what she's doing.

37:09.920 --> 37:10.760
You…

37:20.320 --> 37:21.280
Where is it?

37:22.120 --> 37:23.440
The Travel Permits
of the Ministry of Defense.

37:23.520 --> 37:26.000
They ensure
safe passage through Great Yan.

37:31.520 --> 37:35.520
Meiniang, you won't be
transporting goods but people.

37:36.400 --> 37:39.440
Otherwise, why would you need
two Travel Permits?

37:40.560 --> 37:42.160
In the black market,

37:42.240 --> 37:44.440
we only do business, no questions asked.

37:44.520 --> 37:45.560
You should know this, huh?

37:47.880 --> 37:49.000
I'm just curious.

37:49.800 --> 37:52.200
TRAVEL PERMIT
